@startuml clinical-document-sequence
title Assembling and signing a clinical document
autonumber

actor "Author\n(clinician / MIS)" as Doc
participant "DHP\nFHIR server" as DHP
participant "Signing service\n(MyID / E-imzo)" as Sign
actor "Patient" as Pat

note over Doc : the visit is already recorded as\nEncounter + Condition + Observation + Procedure
Doc -> DHP : POST Bundle (document):\nComposition header + referenced resources
Doc -> Sign : sign the document
Sign -> Sign : authenticate signer,\nverify Practitioner / PractitionerRole
Sign --> Doc : signature (hash / signed PDF)
Doc -> DHP : POST Provenance\n(target -> document, agent -> signer, signature)
note over DHP : verifies the signature,\nthen persists the document
...
Pat -> DHP : GET document from "My Documents"
DHP --> Pat : signed document Bundle (+ PDF)
@enduml
